### Test policy "AdminOnly" trên Catalog.API — đủ Create/Update/Delete
### Trước khi chạy: thay 2 biến dưới đây bằng port thật từ Aspire Dashboard

@identityUrl = https://localhost:5243
@catalogUrl  = http://localhost:5222

### Bước 1: Lấy access token cho user thường (alice)
### Mong đợi: 200 OK với access_token kèm claim role=customer
# @name getUserToken
POST {{identityUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password
&client_id=catalogtest
&client_secret=secret
&username=alice
&password=Pass123$
&scope=catalog openid profile

### Bước 2: Lấy access token cho admin
### Mong đợi: 200 OK với access_token kèm claim role=admin
### Password admin trong UsersSeed.cs là "Pass0308@"
# @name getAdminToken
POST {{identityUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password
&client_id=catalogtest
&client_secret=secret
&username=admin
&password=Pass0308@
&scope=catalog openid profile


###  PHẦN A: CREATE  (POST /api/catalog/items)

### CASE A1: CREATE không token  →  401 Unauthorized
POST {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items?api-version=1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9999,
  "name": "Create No Token",
  "description": "Should return 401",
  "price": 9.99,
  "pictureFileName": "1.webp",
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "availableStock": 100,
  "restockThreshold": 0,
  "maxStockThreshold": 200
}

### CASE A2: CREATE với token alice  →  403 Forbidden
POST {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items?api-version=1.0
Authorization: Bearer {{getUserToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9998,
  "name": "Create User Token",
  "description": "Should return 403",
  "price": 9.99,
  "pictureFileName": "1.webp",
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "availableStock": 100,
  "restockThreshold": 0,
  "maxStockThreshold": 200
}

### CASE A3: CREATE với token admin  →  201 Created
POST {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items?api-version=1.0
Authorization: Bearer {{getAdminToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9997,
  "name": "Admin Created Item",
  "description": "Should return 201",
  "price": 19.99,
  "pictureFileName": "1.webp",
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "availableStock": 100,
  "restockThreshold": 0,
  "maxStockThreshold": 200
}


###  PHẦN B: UPDATE  (PUT /api/catalog/items)
###  PUT v1: body chứa cả id  (UpdateItemV1)

### CASE B1: UPDATE không token  →  401 Unauthorized
PUT {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items?api-version=1.0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Update No Token",
  "description": "Should return 401",
  "price": 1.99,
  "pictureFileName": "1.webp",
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "availableStock": 100,
  "restockThreshold": 0,
  "maxStockThreshold": 200
}

### CASE B2: UPDATE với token alice  →  403 Forbidden
PUT {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items?api-version=1.0
Authorization: Bearer {{getUserToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Update User Token",
  "description": "Should return 403",
  "price": 1.99,
  "pictureFileName": "1.webp",
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "availableStock": 100,
  "restockThreshold": 0,
  "maxStockThreshold": 200
}

### CASE B3: UPDATE với token admin  →  201 Created (UpdateItem trả Created)
PUT {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items?api-version=1.0
Authorization: Bearer {{getAdminToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Admin Updated Item",
  "description": "Should return 201",
  "price": 29.99,
  "pictureFileName": "1.webp",
  "catalogTypeId": 1,
  "catalogBrandId": 1,
  "availableStock": 100,
  "restockThreshold": 0,
  "maxStockThreshold": 200
}


###  PHẦN C: DELETE  (DELETE /api/catalog/items/{id})

### CASE C1: DELETE không token  →  401 Unauthorized
DELETE {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items/9997?api-version=1.0

### CASE C2: DELETE với token alice  →  403 Forbidden
DELETE {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items/9997?api-version=1.0
Authorization: Bearer {{getUserToken.response.body.access_token}}

### CASE C3: DELETE với token admin  →  204 No Content
### Lưu ý: Phải bắn CASE A3 trước để có item id=9997 trong DB
DELETE {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items/9997?api-version=1.0
Authorization: Bearer {{getAdminToken.response.body.access_token}}


###  BONUS: Verify GET vẫn public (không áp policy)
###  Mong đợi: 200 OK kể cả không có token
GET {{catalogUrl}}/api/catalog/items?api-version=1.0


###  DEBUG endpoints (giữ lại để debug nhanh khi cần)

### Xem userinfo từ Identity với token admin
GET {{identityUrl}}/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{getAdminToken.response.body.access_token}}

### Xem Catalog đang thấy claim nào với token admin
GET {{catalogUrl}}/debug/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{getAdminToken.response.body.access_token}}
